1
00:01:38,599 --> 00:01:39,319
Do you have any rooms?

2
00:01:40,200 --> 00:01:40,719
Two left.

3
00:01:40,879 --> 00:01:41,640
One at the far end,

4
00:01:42,079 --> 00:01:42,719
and one by the door.

5
00:01:43,480 --> 00:01:44,480
Give me the one at the far end.

6
00:01:44,680 --> 00:01:45,680
Next door is an apartment prostitute.

7
00:01:45,799 --> 00:01:46,519
Do you mind?

8
00:01:46,719 --> 00:01:47,599
Rent is non-refundable.

9
00:01:48,640 --> 00:01:49,359
Never mind, then.

10
00:01:54,840 --> 00:01:56,760
You're in extreme danger right now.

11
00:01:57,560 --> 00:01:58,079
Remember,

12
00:01:58,439 --> 00:01:59,560
don't act on your own.

13
00:01:59,879 --> 00:02:00,319
Otherwise,

14
00:02:00,319 --> 00:02:01,959
I can't guarantee your safety.

15
00:02:12,080 --> 00:02:13,240
I'll take both rooms.

16
00:03:36,520 --> 00:03:38,520
I'd like ten minutes of your time,

17
00:03:38,599 --> 00:03:39,759
for a heart-to-heart,

18
00:03:40,400 --> 00:03:41,360
and to make a friend.

19
00:03:41,879 --> 00:03:44,120
It's just a part-time consulting job,

20
00:03:44,479 --> 00:03:45,360
very simple.

21
00:03:46,759 --> 00:03:47,719
Please.

22
00:03:54,439 --> 00:03:55,560
Yes, I want to call the police.

23
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:03,560
Fish caught in the Taiwan, China Strait,

24
00:04:03,879 --> 00:04:04,919
makes no distinction between us.

25
00:04:05,080 --> 00:04:06,159
If I asked you to come to the mainland,

26
00:04:06,680 --> 00:04:07,439
would you dare?

27
00:04:07,560 --> 00:04:08,479
You name the place.

28
00:04:08,479 --> 00:04:09,039
I'll come to you.

29
00:04:09,240 --> 00:04:10,840
I never thought you'd actually come.

30
00:04:10,960 --> 00:04:12,360
Since we agreed to meet in person,

31
00:04:12,759 --> 00:04:14,000
then we meet in person.

32
00:04:14,479 --> 00:04:15,800
On behalf of my family,

33
00:04:17,720 --> 00:04:19,480
my mother, my wife,

34
00:04:19,480 --> 00:04:21,040
and even the mutt back home,

35
00:04:23,439 --> 00:04:24,399
I want to thank you.

36
00:04:24,519 --> 00:04:25,240
You yourself

37
00:04:25,560 --> 00:04:27,120
are quite different

38
00:04:27,120 --> 00:04:28,319
from the person I imagined.

39
00:04:34,720 --> 00:04:35,399
Who is it?

40
00:04:44,160 --> 00:04:46,120
Sir, looking for some service?

41
00:05:13,920 --> 00:05:14,920
I'll take a shower first.

42
00:05:15,079 --> 00:05:16,079
Take your time talking.

43
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:38,000
Mr. Zhu told me

44
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:39,240
that you like coffee.

45
00:05:40,360 --> 00:05:42,279
Brought specially from Taiwan, China.

46
00:05:42,600 --> 00:05:43,240
Have a taste.

47
00:05:45,480 --> 00:05:46,879
The mainland has coffee too.

48
00:05:47,560 --> 00:05:49,800
I didn't cross the sea to drink coffee here.

49
00:05:50,240 --> 00:05:50,920
Where is he?

50
00:05:51,319 --> 00:05:52,560
He thought

51
00:05:52,920 --> 00:05:54,720
you'd stick to the agreed plan.

52
00:05:55,519 --> 00:05:56,319
I thought

53
00:05:56,319 --> 00:05:59,319
he'd stick to the original plan.

54
00:06:01,319 --> 00:06:01,959
What,

55
00:06:03,519 --> 00:06:05,319
are all bosses like this?

56
00:06:05,800 --> 00:06:07,360
Making casual promises at first,

57
00:06:07,360 --> 00:06:08,759
saying whatever they want,

58
00:06:09,000 --> 00:06:10,839
never caring if they can deliver?

59
00:06:11,680 --> 00:06:13,279
Didn't we agree from the start

60
00:06:13,279 --> 00:06:15,040
to follow my schedule?

61
00:06:16,720 --> 00:06:17,920
Things were too rushed.

62
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:19,319
There was no time.

63
00:06:20,120 --> 00:06:20,759
He wasn't free.

64
00:06:24,120 --> 00:06:25,480
What do you mean, "not free"?

65
00:06:26,519 --> 00:06:27,600
What is he busy with?

66
00:06:27,839 --> 00:06:29,120
Negotiating with the Americans?

67
00:06:29,639 --> 00:06:32,199
To pull their carriers from the strait?

68
00:06:32,199 --> 00:06:34,560
And grabbing some local specialties too?

69
00:06:34,639 --> 00:06:35,600
Kaoliang liquor?

70
00:06:35,600 --> 00:06:36,600
Or oolong tea?

71
00:06:36,800 --> 00:06:38,439
I'll arrange your extraction shortly.

72
00:06:39,560 --> 00:06:40,639
Save your complaints

73
00:06:41,360 --> 00:06:43,000
for when you two meet.

74
00:06:43,759 --> 00:06:44,319
Mr. Zhu said

75
00:06:44,319 --> 00:06:46,439
you still have one last piece of intel

76
00:06:47,240 --> 00:06:48,199
for me to take back first.

77
00:06:55,240 --> 00:06:56,800
If you can't take it back,

78
00:06:57,120 --> 00:06:58,959
will you just abandon me too?

79
00:07:12,240 --> 00:07:13,560
Whatever Mr. Zhu says,

80
00:07:14,079 --> 00:07:15,079
that is what I must do.

81
00:07:15,639 --> 00:07:16,600
Please understand.

82
00:07:19,199 --> 00:07:19,839
Fine.

83
00:07:22,199 --> 00:07:23,680
Then tell him this:

84
00:07:24,319 --> 00:07:25,800
the intel is still on the mainland.

85
00:07:26,560 --> 00:07:29,480
First ensure I reach Taiwan, China safely,

86
00:07:29,519 --> 00:07:31,199
then we'll talk about the rest.

87
00:07:33,560 --> 00:07:34,120
Also,

88
00:07:34,480 --> 00:07:36,120
that bank card you gave me,

89
00:07:36,360 --> 00:07:38,639
I just checked it at an ATM.

90
00:07:39,279 --> 00:07:40,199
The amount is wrong.

91
00:07:40,720 --> 00:07:41,759
It's way short.

92
00:07:45,600 --> 00:07:48,399
No overtime for Taiwan, China accountants?

93
00:07:52,759 --> 00:07:54,240
You're very different

94
00:07:55,319 --> 00:07:56,319
from what I imagined.

95
00:07:56,759 --> 00:07:57,920
Very vulgar, right?

96
00:07:59,199 --> 00:08:00,079
That's how it should be.

97
00:08:01,000 --> 00:08:02,399
Clarity before courtesy.

98
00:08:03,199 --> 00:08:04,279
Once I see the money,

99
00:08:04,279 --> 00:08:05,639
then we'll talk about the rest.

100
00:08:06,079 --> 00:08:07,360
Then how can I be sure

101
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:09,360
your intel is worth that much?

102
00:08:10,240 --> 00:08:12,439
How can I be sure you'll hand it over?

103
00:08:15,319 --> 00:08:18,720
Aren't we all at the gambling table now?

104
00:08:19,199 --> 00:08:20,439
Lee Teng-hui is gambling.

105
00:08:21,439 --> 00:08:22,680
The Americans are gambling.

106
00:08:23,920 --> 00:08:24,839
I'm gambling.

107
00:08:25,279 --> 00:08:26,959
You should take a gamble, too.

108
00:08:28,480 --> 00:08:30,079
How critical this intel is,

109
00:08:30,800 --> 00:08:33,240
its impact on the Taiwan, China Strait—

110
00:08:34,080 --> 00:08:36,200
if you didn't know full well,

111
00:08:36,519 --> 00:08:38,519
you wouldn't have come to meet me.

112
00:08:42,039 --> 00:08:42,759
In the beginning, Zhu Yingjia

113
00:08:42,759 --> 00:08:45,120
talked to me about ideals and faith.

114
00:08:45,679 --> 00:08:46,960
Now that you have openly embraced

115
00:08:46,960 --> 00:08:48,440
"Taiwan, China independence,"

116
00:08:48,440 --> 00:08:49,799
let's just talk money.

117
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:54,080
After daybreak,

118
00:08:54,639 --> 00:08:55,399
eight o'clock sharp.

119
00:08:56,360 --> 00:08:57,360
Either we trade,

120
00:08:58,000 --> 00:09:00,360
or I turn myself in.

121
00:09:08,639 --> 00:09:09,519
Treason.

122
00:09:11,840 --> 00:09:12,600
Leaking state secrets.

123
00:09:14,320 --> 00:09:15,759
Crime of Endangering National Security.

124
00:09:17,759 --> 00:09:19,240
How many years if you turn yourself in?

125
00:09:19,440 --> 00:09:20,399
Have you calculated that?

126
00:09:21,679 --> 00:09:22,960
I'm a mathematician.

127
00:09:23,919 --> 00:09:25,399
I do the math better than you.

128
00:09:25,960 --> 00:09:28,120
Surrendering gets me a reduced sentence.

129
00:09:28,519 --> 00:09:30,360
It's the optimal choice right now.

130
00:09:31,759 --> 00:09:32,639
Then again,

131
00:09:33,240 --> 00:09:34,399
having come this far,

132
00:09:34,840 --> 00:09:36,600
do I have any other choice?

133
00:09:37,039 --> 00:09:38,039
I can only gamble.

134
00:09:42,639 --> 00:09:43,519
Believe it or not,

135
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:47,399
Mainland security might be all around us.

136
00:09:48,679 --> 00:09:50,200
Maybe right beneath our feet,

137
00:09:50,200 --> 00:09:51,720
inside this very building.

138
00:10:05,240 --> 00:10:06,320
For your sake,

139
00:10:07,840 --> 00:10:09,320
I was poisoned.

140
00:10:10,120 --> 00:10:13,120
I take handfuls of liver pills daily.

141
00:10:14,080 --> 00:10:15,440
If it were you,

142
00:10:17,360 --> 00:10:19,039
you'd talk about money, too.

143
00:10:41,039 --> 00:10:42,279
Ever since he got back from 1018,

144
00:10:42,279 --> 00:10:43,159
he's been quiet.

145
00:10:43,679 --> 00:10:44,960
He's either asleep,

146
00:10:45,240 --> 00:10:46,679
or with his eyes open,

147
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:49,120
lying in bed, lost in thought.

148
00:10:49,919 --> 00:10:50,799
Did you know?

149
00:10:50,879 --> 00:10:52,440
He requested his leave well in advance.

150
00:10:52,759 --> 00:10:55,200
Institute 761 strictly vets sick leave.

151
00:10:55,480 --> 00:10:57,320
He didn't come into this unprepared.

152
00:10:57,559 --> 00:10:59,600
He's smarter than we thought.

153
00:10:59,919 --> 00:11:01,159
I didn't expect this guy Cao

154
00:11:01,159 --> 00:11:02,679
to have such nerves of steel.

155
00:11:03,480 --> 00:11:06,679
Think that woman is from Taiwan, China?

156
00:11:07,039 --> 00:11:08,200
Our people have already arrived.

157
00:11:08,240 --> 00:11:09,480
Someone will look into her background.

158
00:11:10,080 --> 00:11:12,759
Coming all this way to meet the MIB...

159
00:11:13,080 --> 00:11:14,480
Do you think he's taking a gamble,

160
00:11:14,919 --> 00:11:16,080
or is he completely sure of himself?

161
00:11:17,080 --> 00:11:18,480
It's more like a strategic game.

162
00:11:19,000 --> 00:11:19,960
Like chess.

163
00:11:20,799 --> 00:11:22,480
Depends if he moves three pieces at once,

164
00:11:22,480 --> 00:11:23,759
or takes three steps to move one.

165
00:11:26,679 --> 00:11:28,360
Then what about our neighbor?

166
00:11:31,519 --> 00:11:32,919
Where do you think he is right now?

167
00:11:40,799 --> 00:11:41,679
Has he reached Zhuhai?

168
00:11:41,919 --> 00:11:42,519
Just arrived.

169
00:11:42,879 --> 00:11:44,000
Heading to Hong Kong, China soon.

170
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:44,919
Leaving right now.

171
00:11:45,120 --> 00:11:46,360
The professor is out of control.

172
00:11:46,559 --> 00:11:48,000
The original pickup plan is canceled.

173
00:11:48,399 --> 00:11:49,960
Someone will stabilize him first.

174
00:11:50,320 --> 00:11:52,080
You take over the follow-up operation.

175
00:12:17,639 --> 00:12:20,120
Engineer Jia, let me tell you something.

176
00:12:21,080 --> 00:12:23,279
Hong Kong, China exchange slot is yours.

177
00:12:23,600 --> 00:12:24,919
Just a verbal notice for now.

178
00:12:25,039 --> 00:12:26,399
The official document will come next week.

179
00:12:26,399 --> 00:12:27,759
What's going on?

180
00:12:27,759 --> 00:12:29,639
Didn't I recommend Lao Cao?

181
00:12:29,679 --> 00:12:30,799
He took sick leave.

182
00:12:30,919 --> 00:12:31,919
He hasn't been sleeping lately.

183
00:12:32,120 --> 00:12:32,919
It's getting worse.

184
00:12:33,080 --> 00:12:34,799
He went to Guangzhou for Chinese medicine.

185
00:12:34,799 --> 00:12:35,559
When did he leave?

186
00:12:36,159 --> 00:12:37,240
He didn't come in today.

187
00:12:39,320 --> 00:12:39,919
Understood.

188
00:13:06,799 --> 00:13:07,480
Waiter!

189
00:13:09,399 --> 00:13:09,799
Check, please.

190
00:13:10,000 --> 00:13:10,879
The check, boss!

191
00:13:11,159 --> 00:13:12,240
Just a moment, let me add it up.

192
00:13:12,240 --> 00:13:15,759
That'll be 135 yuan in total.

193
00:13:20,799 --> 00:13:22,759
Mr. Cao Liaoping.

194
00:13:27,919 --> 00:13:28,720
Where's the intel?

195
00:13:34,639 --> 00:13:35,519
Where's my money?

196
00:13:36,320 --> 00:13:38,000
Hand over the goods first.

197
00:13:39,840 --> 00:13:41,000
Mr. Cao, calm down.

198
00:13:41,000 --> 00:13:42,080
Give me the goods, and you get the money.

199
00:13:42,240 --> 00:13:42,960
Get out of the way!

200
00:13:45,240 --> 00:13:46,240
Come take her money!

201
00:13:47,559 --> 00:13:48,519
Come take her money!

202
00:13:48,639 --> 00:13:49,080
Come on!

203
00:13:49,759 --> 00:13:50,480
Police!

204
00:13:50,679 --> 00:13:51,080
Out of the way!

205
00:13:51,720 --> 00:13:52,200
Move!

206
00:13:52,519 --> 00:13:53,000
Police!

207
00:13:53,200 --> 00:13:53,840
Hands up!

208
00:13:54,639 --> 00:13:55,039
Hands up!

209
00:13:55,039 --> 00:13:57,879
Move, move, move!

210
00:13:58,559 --> 00:13:59,159
Run!

211
00:13:59,559 --> 00:14:00,159
Run!

212
00:14:00,720 --> 00:14:01,639
Run!

213
00:14:01,879 --> 00:14:02,840
Don't move! Hands up!

214
00:14:03,159 --> 00:14:04,360
Hands up! Hands up!

215
00:14:04,840 --> 00:14:05,879
I was just giving her the wallet!

216
00:14:06,799 --> 00:14:07,840
What are you doing?

217
00:14:07,840 --> 00:14:08,480
We're arresting you!

218
00:14:08,480 --> 00:14:09,480
Why are you arresting me?

219
00:14:09,480 --> 00:14:10,879
I just came here to eat!

220
00:14:10,879 --> 00:14:12,279
Why are you arresting me?

221
00:14:12,399 --> 00:14:13,960
I was only eating here!

222
00:14:13,960 --> 00:14:14,759
I went to pay the bill,

223
00:14:14,759 --> 00:14:16,320
and then that guy just stood up!

224
00:14:16,679 --> 00:14:18,320
How could I be with him?

225
00:14:18,320 --> 00:14:19,759
I don't even know him!

226
00:14:26,080 --> 00:14:27,519
You can't do this!

227
00:14:28,240 --> 00:14:29,679
I want a lawyer!

228
00:14:30,559 --> 00:14:31,519
Listen to me!

229
00:14:31,799 --> 00:14:32,759
I'm innocent!

230
00:14:32,759 --> 00:14:33,639
Step back!

231
00:14:35,440 --> 00:14:37,279
Can you understand what I'm saying?

232
00:14:37,639 --> 00:14:39,240
I'm being framed!

233
00:14:39,240 --> 00:14:41,039
I want to see a lawyer!

234
00:14:41,799 --> 00:14:43,279
A lawyer!

235
00:14:44,279 --> 00:14:46,039
I'm innocent!

236
00:14:46,320 --> 00:14:47,080
Quiet down!

237
00:14:47,080 --> 00:14:48,639
Can you understand me?

238
00:14:51,120 --> 00:14:52,679
You can't treat me like this!

239
00:14:53,120 --> 00:14:54,320
Let me out!

240
00:15:14,000 --> 00:15:14,799
Professor Cao,

241
00:15:15,799 --> 00:15:17,720
listen carefully to what I'm about to say.

242
00:15:18,519 --> 00:15:21,399
The diner waiter is a major robbery convict,

243
00:15:21,840 --> 00:15:23,919
and you're his accomplice.

244
00:15:24,519 --> 00:15:26,440
The robbery was your idea.

245
00:15:26,679 --> 00:15:27,840
In 30 minutes,

246
00:15:28,080 --> 00:15:29,759
the police will investigate this...

247
00:15:30,720 --> 00:15:32,360
Wait, sorry, I misspoke.

248
00:15:33,480 --> 00:15:35,919
The police will announce the findings.

249
00:15:36,240 --> 00:15:37,960
What awaits you is either prison,

250
00:15:37,960 --> 00:15:39,200
or repatriation to the mainland.

251
00:15:46,120 --> 00:15:47,799
Who told you to pass this message to me?

252
00:15:49,320 --> 00:15:51,320
A lawyer will be here shortly.

253
00:15:51,759 --> 00:15:53,919
Remember, you only have one chance.

254
00:15:54,320 --> 00:15:55,960
Think carefully about what to say.

255
00:15:56,360 --> 00:15:58,919
Give him your message for Taiwan, China.

256
00:16:08,080 --> 00:16:09,240
Are you kidding me?

257
00:16:09,240 --> 00:16:10,840
It's dead quiet out here,

258
00:16:12,039 --> 00:16:13,200
and I still need to get back for dinner.

259
00:16:30,960 --> 00:16:33,279
Mr. Cao, I'm your defense lawyer.

260
00:16:33,679 --> 00:16:35,320
Hong Kong, China police now accuse you

261
00:16:35,320 --> 00:16:37,679
of planning and committing public robbery.

262
00:16:38,159 --> 00:16:39,600
I need to know your side of the story.

263
00:16:40,840 --> 00:16:42,480
I want to hear the actual facts,

264
00:16:42,679 --> 00:16:43,960
not some fabricated story.

265
00:16:45,320 --> 00:16:47,000
Whatever you want to say, and to whom,

266
00:16:47,000 --> 00:16:47,960
you can tell me.

267
00:16:50,120 --> 00:16:51,200
You're from the mainland.

268
00:16:51,720 --> 00:16:53,279
To clear a mainland suspect,

269
00:16:53,440 --> 00:16:55,039
you'd definitely need a mainland lawyer.

270
00:16:57,399 --> 00:16:59,360
Can you understand if I speak Cantonese?

271
00:17:00,559 --> 00:17:02,799
How do I know if you're legit or not?

272
00:17:03,519 --> 00:17:05,000
If you don't mind wasting time,

273
00:17:05,240 --> 00:17:06,519
I can have my law license

274
00:17:06,519 --> 00:17:07,480
brought here for you to see.

275
00:17:09,039 --> 00:17:10,720
Hong Kong, China is ruled by law.

276
00:17:11,480 --> 00:17:13,519
For a lawyer to visit a detained client

277
00:17:13,880 --> 00:17:15,079
is part of the legal system,

278
00:17:15,720 --> 00:17:17,759
with strict rules and procedures.

279
00:17:18,519 --> 00:17:19,599
In such a short time,

280
00:17:19,799 --> 00:17:21,720
you couldn't have gotten here so fast.

281
00:17:24,160 --> 00:17:25,160
Special cases call for special measures.

282
00:17:25,559 --> 00:17:26,559
I have my ways.

283
00:17:27,160 --> 00:17:28,200
You have your choices.

284
00:17:28,880 --> 00:17:30,440
Your only real choice is to trust me.

285
00:17:32,599 --> 00:17:36,359
Can a Taiwan, China lawyer control Hong Kong, China police?

286
00:17:38,680 --> 00:17:40,440
Hong Kong, China will be handed over soon.

287
00:17:40,640 --> 00:17:41,720
People are restless.

288
00:17:41,759 --> 00:17:43,240
Everyone has their own agenda.

289
00:17:43,599 --> 00:17:44,599
Feigned compliance

290
00:17:44,599 --> 00:17:45,920
is already doing you a favor.

291
00:17:46,640 --> 00:17:47,599
"People are restless."

292
00:17:48,039 --> 00:17:48,920
"Feigned compliance."

293
00:17:49,519 --> 00:17:50,519
If it were you,

294
00:17:50,519 --> 00:17:52,720
would you dutifully work your last shift?

295
00:17:55,960 --> 00:17:57,119
Framing me,

296
00:17:57,599 --> 00:17:58,839
locking me up,

297
00:17:58,839 --> 00:18:00,000
and threatening me here...

298
00:18:00,279 --> 00:18:02,400
Is this how you treat your guests?

299
00:18:02,880 --> 00:18:04,160
I don't understand that,

300
00:18:04,160 --> 00:18:05,279
and neither will the judge.

301
00:18:05,880 --> 00:18:07,240
I need a different statement.

302
00:18:07,559 --> 00:18:08,319
Do you understand?

303
00:18:08,920 --> 00:18:10,160
What if I refuse?

304
00:18:12,240 --> 00:18:14,039
Lawyer visits have a time limit.

305
00:18:14,039 --> 00:18:16,559
You have three minutes left, Mr. Cao.

306
00:18:36,480 --> 00:18:37,799
Create a diversion.

307
00:18:37,799 --> 00:18:39,240
First, set a trap for Cao Liaoping,

308
00:18:39,240 --> 00:18:40,519
then bring him over,

309
00:18:40,519 --> 00:18:42,400
and send someone to negotiate with him.

310
00:18:42,799 --> 00:18:44,000
The people sent from Taiwan, China

311
00:18:44,119 --> 00:18:45,519
used both threats and inducements,

312
00:18:45,640 --> 00:18:47,200
leading him by the nose as well.

313
00:18:47,240 --> 00:18:49,440
This situation is just like a tug-of-war.

314
00:18:50,319 --> 00:18:52,160
A smart person always plans ahead,

315
00:18:52,160 --> 00:18:53,119
maps out every step,

316
00:18:53,240 --> 00:18:55,599
and takes the initiative when possible.

317
00:18:55,720 --> 00:18:56,440
Setting up a game

318
00:18:57,240 --> 00:18:58,400
is like peeling an onion.

319
00:18:58,480 --> 00:19:00,079
Peel it away layer by layer.

320
00:19:00,799 --> 00:19:02,960
It all comes down to who thinks further,

321
00:19:03,279 --> 00:19:04,079
who thinks deeper.

322
00:19:04,519 --> 00:19:06,759
How were the lawyer's procedures sorted?

323
00:19:07,160 --> 00:19:09,200
The legal system should be hard to bypass.

324
00:19:09,519 --> 00:19:10,599
This is Hong Kong, China.

325
00:19:10,880 --> 00:19:11,839
Rules are rigid,

326
00:19:12,079 --> 00:19:13,200
but people are flexible.

327
00:19:13,319 --> 00:19:15,119
The police force is run by foreigners too.

328
00:19:15,559 --> 00:19:17,240
Would they dare open such a big loophole?

329
00:19:17,240 --> 00:19:18,720
The handover is coming soon.

330
00:19:18,920 --> 00:19:21,200
The expats are eager to return to Britain.

331
00:19:26,920 --> 00:19:27,640
The diner.

332
00:19:28,000 --> 00:19:29,440
There's something in the toilet.

333
00:19:29,839 --> 00:19:30,359
Hurry.

334
00:19:31,279 --> 00:19:32,599
Not a single penny less.

335
00:19:33,079 --> 00:19:34,799
Arrange my trip to Taipei immediately.

336
00:19:36,200 --> 00:19:38,720
What Mr. Zhu wants is in Hong Kong, China.

337
00:19:38,920 --> 00:19:39,920
Where in Hong Kong, China?

338
00:19:40,400 --> 00:19:41,240
It's split up.

339
00:19:42,200 --> 00:19:43,680
Hidden in several places.

340
00:19:43,680 --> 00:19:44,720
One piece of it

341
00:19:44,720 --> 00:19:47,599
is taped inside the diner's toilet tank.

342
00:19:47,880 --> 00:19:48,960
You can go verify it.

343
00:19:49,160 --> 00:19:50,079
Once I get the money

344
00:19:50,400 --> 00:19:52,039
and arrive safely in Taipei,

345
00:19:52,359 --> 00:19:54,400
I'll hand over the rest of the intel.

346
00:19:54,640 --> 00:19:56,160
I'll go get it. You wait here for Jinlan.

347
00:20:07,079 --> 00:20:08,480
Lawyer Kan, you're up.

348
00:20:13,240 --> 00:20:13,880
My surname is Kan.

349
00:20:14,440 --> 00:20:16,200
You can call me Lawyer Kan.

350
00:20:16,559 --> 00:20:17,240
Mr. Cao.

351
00:20:17,440 --> 00:20:19,000
The police are accusing you

352
00:20:19,000 --> 00:20:20,799
of committing robbery in public.

353
00:20:21,240 --> 00:20:22,759
I need to know everything.

354
00:20:23,119 --> 00:20:25,119
Tell me whatever you'd like to share.

355
00:20:25,599 --> 00:20:26,720
You're not from the mainland.

356
00:20:26,920 --> 00:20:27,799
Is there a problem with that?

357
00:20:28,039 --> 00:20:29,039
You're from Taiwan, China.

358
00:20:31,039 --> 00:20:32,039
Whatever you say,

359
00:20:32,480 --> 00:20:34,519
our friends over there can hear it.

360
00:20:37,480 --> 00:20:38,440
Just how many people

361
00:20:38,680 --> 00:20:40,319
are you going to send to talk to me?

362
00:20:41,759 --> 00:20:42,440
What do you mean?

363
00:20:43,519 --> 00:20:44,759
Someone already spoke to you?

364
00:20:45,440 --> 00:20:46,240
Also a lawyer?

365
00:20:47,240 --> 00:20:48,319
Aren't you a lawyer?

366
00:20:49,200 --> 00:20:50,599
Was that person a man or a woman?

367
00:20:50,799 --> 00:20:51,400
A woman.

368
00:20:51,519 --> 00:20:53,279
Height, build, what was she wearing?

369
00:20:53,440 --> 00:20:54,119
Same as you.

370
00:20:54,440 --> 00:20:55,440
Wearing a gray suit, too.

371
00:20:55,720 --> 00:20:57,039
Why should I tell you?

372
00:20:57,039 --> 00:20:58,319
What are you people trying to pull?

373
00:20:58,759 --> 00:21:00,400
You got played, you idiot!

374
00:21:01,079 --> 00:21:03,000
Where's the stuff for Mr. Zhu? Tell me!

375
00:21:32,279 --> 00:21:33,319
Short-answer question.

376
00:21:33,319 --> 00:21:35,119
How do you determine which direction

377
00:21:35,119 --> 00:21:37,039
your target will head after stepping out?

378
00:21:37,559 --> 00:21:38,920
Most people subconsciously assume

379
00:21:38,920 --> 00:21:40,400
right-handers will always go right.

380
00:21:40,680 --> 00:21:42,440
In the field, it's quite the opposite.

381
00:21:42,720 --> 00:21:44,880
They instinctively tend to favor the left,

382
00:21:44,960 --> 00:21:46,319
with over 80 percent probability.

383
00:21:46,799 --> 00:21:47,759
When evading surveillance,

384
00:21:47,759 --> 00:21:50,839
they instinctively stick to the shadows.

385
00:21:50,960 --> 00:21:53,480
Fewer people, complex alleys, busy roads...

386
00:21:53,480 --> 00:21:54,559
Even the wind direction

387
00:21:54,880 --> 00:21:56,200
plays a part in their choice.

388
00:21:56,440 --> 00:21:57,680
Lin Kanshan, you're spacing out again.

389
00:21:57,839 --> 00:21:59,279
Repeat what I just said.

390
00:22:01,079 --> 00:22:01,880
Analytical question.

391
00:22:02,039 --> 00:22:03,000
Put yourself in their shoes.

392
00:22:03,039 --> 00:22:04,480
If you're going to meet a contact,

393
00:22:04,960 --> 00:22:06,519
and you aren't sure it's safe,

394
00:22:06,799 --> 00:22:08,839
you'd never carry the intel on you.

395
00:22:08,880 --> 00:22:09,960
Where would you hide it?

396
00:22:10,160 --> 00:22:10,720
Most likely,

397
00:22:10,720 --> 00:22:12,799
somewhere near the meeting point.

398
00:22:13,039 --> 00:22:14,440
A place to advance or retreat,

399
00:22:14,640 --> 00:22:15,759
instantly retrievable,

400
00:22:15,759 --> 00:22:17,400
and thoroughly cased beforehand.

401
00:22:17,680 --> 00:22:18,480
Think about it.

402
00:22:30,200 --> 00:22:31,839
The crowd is a shifting labyrinth.

403
00:22:32,119 --> 00:22:33,559
You're not looking for a person,

404
00:22:33,559 --> 00:22:34,400
but an anomaly.

405
00:22:34,839 --> 00:22:37,079
The pace of a stride, where the eyes land,

406
00:22:37,319 --> 00:22:38,839
even the sway of a coat hem.

407
00:22:39,240 --> 00:22:40,759
Watch for sudden pauses,

408
00:22:41,119 --> 00:22:41,960
deliberate detours,

409
00:22:41,960 --> 00:22:43,799
or shoulders glancing back repeatedly.

410
00:22:44,039 --> 00:22:46,359
Those subtle mismatches with surroundings

411
00:22:46,759 --> 00:22:48,720
are the shadows you need to lock onto.

412
00:23:41,240 --> 00:23:42,480
Stop looking. Let's go.

413
00:24:41,359 --> 00:24:41,960
Take a seat.

414
00:24:48,720 --> 00:24:50,599
I'm just a messenger today.

415
00:24:51,519 --> 00:24:53,039
The message from my superiors,

416
00:24:53,519 --> 00:24:54,759
I can't afford to miss a single word.

417
00:24:55,599 --> 00:24:56,640
To show good faith,

418
00:24:57,000 --> 00:24:58,400
Taipei's position is that

419
00:24:58,720 --> 00:25:00,039
as long as you're willing to consider,

420
00:25:00,440 --> 00:25:02,759
you can name any condition.

421
00:25:11,680 --> 00:25:13,799
Actually, Old Xiao isn't my only asset.

422
00:25:14,599 --> 00:25:16,400
In mainland government, military, and firms,

423
00:25:16,920 --> 00:25:17,799
I have people everywhere.

424
00:25:18,359 --> 00:25:19,200
I can hand them all over to you.

425
00:25:20,240 --> 00:25:21,240
Conservatively speaking,

426
00:25:21,480 --> 00:25:22,880
it can let you complete ahead of schedule

427
00:25:22,880 --> 00:25:24,960
all your work targets before retirement.

428
00:25:26,039 --> 00:25:27,319
The Taiwan, China Strait is just a card.

429
00:25:27,640 --> 00:25:28,680
Both sides are playing it.

430
00:25:30,240 --> 00:25:33,240
This year, next, in five or ten years...

431
00:25:33,799 --> 00:25:35,200
These people in my hands

432
00:25:36,079 --> 00:25:37,559
can all become stepping stones for you.

433
00:25:38,599 --> 00:25:39,880
As for the intelligence you need,

434
00:25:40,519 --> 00:25:42,160
as long as Mr. Zhu cooperates,

435
00:25:42,839 --> 00:25:45,559
the fakes can all be turned into facts.

436
00:25:46,200 --> 00:25:47,440
We can provide all of it.

437
00:25:49,599 --> 00:25:50,359
What else?

438
00:25:53,160 --> 00:25:53,960
As for compensation,

439
00:25:54,359 --> 00:25:55,680
Mr. Zhu's word is,

440
00:25:56,359 --> 00:25:58,160
since you're the one he values most,

441
00:25:58,640 --> 00:26:00,559
you name all the terms.

442
00:26:01,039 --> 00:26:03,400
No ceiling, no counteroffer.

443
00:26:05,319 --> 00:26:09,359
A banquet can't just serve tea, right?

444
00:26:10,119 --> 00:26:11,359
What's your appetizer?

445
00:26:15,839 --> 00:26:19,400
There's more than one traitor around you.

446
00:26:20,440 --> 00:26:22,920
One of them is hiding very deep.

447
00:26:23,880 --> 00:26:25,119
All I can tell you is,

448
00:26:25,640 --> 00:26:28,640
this person has deep ties to you.

449
00:26:38,960 --> 00:26:40,599
Mr. Zhu is a smart man.

450
00:26:41,240 --> 00:26:42,640
He has guts and plenty of courage.

451
00:26:43,279 --> 00:26:45,440
His nerves are much steadier than I thought.

452
00:26:46,599 --> 00:26:48,000
Riding solo into danger.

453
00:26:48,000 --> 00:26:48,920
To tell you the truth,

454
00:26:49,240 --> 00:26:50,400
I used to admire him quite a bit.

455
00:26:50,839 --> 00:26:51,640
You two have met?

456
00:26:52,920 --> 00:26:54,440
If I remember correctly,

457
00:26:55,200 --> 00:26:56,759
we might have crossed paths once.

458
00:26:58,240 --> 00:27:00,279
Excuse me, may I borrow that newspaper?

459
00:27:00,759 --> 00:27:01,200
Here.

460
00:27:01,839 --> 00:27:02,359
Thank you.

461
00:27:02,599 --> 00:27:04,119
They were all gone when I went to get one.

462
00:27:04,880 --> 00:27:05,599
You're welcome.

463
00:27:13,680 --> 00:27:14,960
Still, I've never heard him mention it.

464
00:27:17,519 --> 00:27:18,920
But starting today,

465
00:27:19,480 --> 00:27:21,000
my impression of him has slipped a bit.

466
00:27:22,599 --> 00:27:24,319
Was it how I passed the message?

467
00:27:32,160 --> 00:27:33,319
The tea is clear and bright,

468
00:27:34,359 --> 00:27:35,359
smooth on the palate.

469
00:27:36,519 --> 00:27:37,559
After steeping,

470
00:27:37,559 --> 00:27:38,599
the leaves are supple and lustrous,

471
00:27:39,039 --> 00:27:40,559
green with red rims.

472
00:27:41,200 --> 00:27:42,119
Slightly bitter with a sweet finish.

473
00:27:42,920 --> 00:27:44,400
Did you bring this from the mainland,

474
00:27:44,400 --> 00:27:45,519
or find it in Hong Kong, China?

475
00:27:45,559 --> 00:27:47,000
A token carried from afar.

476
00:27:47,640 --> 00:27:48,880
When hosting an honored guest,

477
00:27:48,880 --> 00:27:50,640
I had to hand-carry the best myself.

478
00:27:51,000 --> 00:27:52,079
Sincerity makes all the difference.

479
00:27:58,240 --> 00:28:00,359
To be frank, tea drinking is simple.

480
00:28:01,000 --> 00:28:02,519
As long as it isn't overly bitter,

481
00:28:02,920 --> 00:28:03,839
anyone can enjoy it.

482
00:28:04,160 --> 00:28:05,160
Astringency, however, is unacceptable.

483
00:28:06,119 --> 00:28:08,319
Know how people in Ronghai judge tea?

484
00:28:08,599 --> 00:28:09,400
Just one rule:

485
00:28:09,680 --> 00:28:11,720
Any word describing astringency,

486
00:28:11,839 --> 00:28:13,319
each and every one of them—

487
00:28:13,559 --> 00:28:15,680
bitter, sour, numbing, or harsh—

488
00:28:15,920 --> 00:28:16,680
gets docked without exception.

489
00:28:19,200 --> 00:28:21,279
Brother, your sincerity is undeniable.

490
00:28:21,599 --> 00:28:22,319
Too bad...

491
00:28:23,400 --> 00:28:24,680
the tea dealer took you for a ride.

492
00:28:31,319 --> 00:28:33,160
Tea and sincerity aren't the same thing.

493
00:28:33,680 --> 00:28:34,640
Either bring nothing,

494
00:28:34,920 --> 00:28:36,480
or bring only the finest.

495
00:28:38,400 --> 00:28:40,759
If Mr. Zhu truly valued me,

496
00:28:41,839 --> 00:28:42,880
he wouldn't have failed to show up.

497
00:28:45,200 --> 00:28:46,160
Does he not value you,

498
00:28:46,880 --> 00:28:47,960
or did he fail to take a fancy to you?

499
00:28:54,279 --> 00:28:55,799
It's because he values you so much

500
00:28:55,799 --> 00:28:57,480
that he didn't dare meet you lightly.

501
00:28:57,720 --> 00:28:58,599
He feared you wouldn't show up,

502
00:28:58,759 --> 00:28:59,680
feared you'd turn him down.

503
00:29:00,559 --> 00:29:01,319
You know how it goes.

504
00:29:02,440 --> 00:29:03,839
When you care that much about someone,

505
00:29:05,200 --> 00:29:06,640
there's just so much more to fear.

506
00:29:24,079 --> 00:29:25,279
Do you have anything else to say?

507
00:29:31,880 --> 00:29:32,440
Brother Qi.

508
00:29:43,599 --> 00:29:47,200
I couldn't speak openly on the mainland.

509
00:29:48,200 --> 00:29:49,480
It's rare you come to Hong Kong, China.

510
00:29:50,079 --> 00:29:51,960
Frankly, if you weren't interested,

511
00:29:52,200 --> 00:29:53,680
you wouldn't have come to see me, right?

512
00:29:55,359 --> 00:29:57,720
Brother Qi, just give the nod today,

513
00:29:57,720 --> 00:29:59,160
and all the details of our cooperation

514
00:29:59,799 --> 00:30:00,640
will be entirely up to you.

515
00:30:05,920 --> 00:30:07,559
I only talk to Zhu Yingjia.

516
00:30:08,079 --> 00:30:08,640
You...

517
00:30:09,240 --> 00:30:10,039
aren't qualified.

518
00:30:19,559 --> 00:30:20,119
Brother Qi.

519
00:30:26,960 --> 00:30:27,519
Brother Qi!

520
00:31:01,799 --> 00:31:04,359
Sorry, sir! Sorry, sir!

521
00:31:04,359 --> 00:31:05,480
Just went to the restroom. The restroom.

522
00:31:05,480 --> 00:31:06,039
Hurry up and drive off!

523
00:31:06,039 --> 00:31:06,680
You can't park here!

524
00:31:06,680 --> 00:31:07,559
I'm right here! I'm right here!

525
00:31:07,559 --> 00:31:08,440
Alright, alright!

526
00:32:27,680 --> 00:32:28,960
Which one of you two did he see?

527
00:32:30,559 --> 00:32:32,079
I arrived at Wing Wah Building first.

528
00:32:32,079 --> 00:32:33,079
Just as I was about to go inside,

529
00:32:33,079 --> 00:32:34,440
Lin Kanshan had already caught up.

530
00:32:34,960 --> 00:32:36,480
He realized the lawyer was in disguise,

531
00:32:36,480 --> 00:32:37,759
but he didn't recognize me.

532
00:32:38,079 --> 00:32:38,799
Are you sure?

533
00:32:39,440 --> 00:32:40,359
I don't think he did.

534
00:32:43,079 --> 00:32:43,759
Where's your proof?

535
00:32:44,319 --> 00:32:45,440
What makes you think so?

536
00:32:46,000 --> 00:32:47,559
If he had recognized me,

537
00:32:47,799 --> 00:32:48,920
he wouldn't have reacted like that.

538
00:32:49,200 --> 00:32:50,200
How did he react?

539
00:32:50,359 --> 00:32:51,519
And how would he react if he did?

540
00:32:53,000 --> 00:32:54,839
I recalled it carefully before getting in.

541
00:32:55,440 --> 00:32:57,079
If he had recognized me on the spot,

542
00:32:57,079 --> 00:32:59,240
his expression, attitude, and reaction

543
00:32:59,240 --> 00:33:00,680
would have been completely different.

544
00:33:02,640 --> 00:33:04,359
If compromised during a mission,

545
00:33:04,519 --> 00:33:05,599
what's the protocol, He Chunxiao?

546
00:33:06,319 --> 00:33:07,440
Terminate all operations.

547
00:33:07,640 --> 00:33:08,759
Evacuate the operative immediately.

548
00:33:09,200 --> 00:33:10,119
He didn't recognize me.

549
00:33:16,079 --> 00:33:17,359
Can you be a hundred percent sure?

550
00:33:18,559 --> 00:33:19,279
I am.

551
00:33:27,079 --> 00:33:28,079
Then there's no need to evacuate.

552
00:33:34,200 --> 00:33:35,519
We just got word.

553
00:33:35,799 --> 00:33:37,079
Superiors want Cao Liaoping bailed out.

554
00:33:39,039 --> 00:33:40,759
British HK police need to coordinate.

555
00:33:40,960 --> 00:33:42,759
We must have authorization to take him.

556
00:33:43,279 --> 00:33:44,160
But that's too slow.

557
00:33:44,839 --> 00:33:45,599
The MIB will definitely

558
00:33:45,599 --> 00:33:47,000
beat us to it and snatch him.

559
00:33:47,119 --> 00:33:48,160
What choice do we have?

560
00:33:49,200 --> 00:33:50,559
A desperate measure.

561
00:33:55,799 --> 00:33:57,160
Cao Liaoping, someone posted your bail.

562
00:33:57,359 --> 00:33:58,119
Come with me.

563
00:33:59,920 --> 00:34:01,160
What, you don't want to leave?

564
00:34:01,279 --> 00:34:02,359
Looking to spend the night here?

565
00:34:03,359 --> 00:34:04,839
I lied earlier.

566
00:34:05,559 --> 00:34:07,119
I concealed my illegal entry.

567
00:34:09,960 --> 00:34:11,000
I want to see a lawyer.

568
00:34:11,960 --> 00:34:12,840
I want to turn myself in.

569
00:34:13,880 --> 00:34:16,320
Cash, new passport, and plane ticket...

570
00:34:16,320 --> 00:34:17,519
They're all ready.

571
00:34:17,760 --> 00:34:19,360
Exactly as you requested.

572
00:34:19,360 --> 00:34:20,079
Without exception.

573
00:34:20,360 --> 00:34:22,880
If you do what I just told you,

574
00:34:23,400 --> 00:34:24,440
tomorrow night,

575
00:34:24,639 --> 00:34:26,840
you can dine late at The Grand Hotel.

576
00:34:27,280 --> 00:34:28,840
This is the best way out,

577
00:34:29,480 --> 00:34:30,559
if you don't want to be

578
00:34:30,559 --> 00:34:32,360
taken back by Mainland State Security.

579
00:34:51,840 --> 00:34:52,639
Hong Kong, China Police,

580
00:34:52,639 --> 00:34:53,760
Badge number 5320,

581
00:34:53,760 --> 00:34:56,559
formally hands over suspect Cao Liaoping.

582
00:34:56,760 --> 00:34:57,480
Yes, sir.

583
00:37:17,639 --> 00:37:18,760
Hurry, run!

584
00:37:22,320 --> 00:37:24,119
Stop! Don't run!

585
00:38:16,679 --> 00:38:18,599
Brother Qi! Brother Qi!

586
00:38:38,239 --> 00:38:39,559
Something went wrong in the OR.

587
00:38:39,719 --> 00:38:41,119
The doctor lost the patient,

588
00:38:41,719 --> 00:38:42,840
and got injured himself.

589
00:38:43,239 --> 00:38:44,079
Yes, that's right.

590
00:38:45,920 --> 00:38:46,639
What about me?

591
00:38:47,280 --> 00:38:49,079
Should I go to Taiwan, China to lay low?

592
00:38:49,079 --> 00:38:49,960
If you come back now,

593
00:38:50,239 --> 00:38:51,880
you'll only confirm you're a spy.

594
00:38:52,039 --> 00:38:53,840
What if they recognize me?

595
00:38:54,039 --> 00:38:55,320
Now that things have turned out like this,

596
00:38:55,480 --> 00:38:56,480
I still have to return to the mainland?

597
00:38:56,480 --> 00:38:56,960
Wouldn't that be...

598
00:38:56,960 --> 00:38:57,360
What are you panicking for?

599
00:38:57,639 --> 00:38:59,000
Go back and run your business as usual.

600
00:38:59,480 --> 00:39:00,920
We have eyes over there too.

601
00:39:01,159 --> 00:39:01,880
If there's real danger,

602
00:39:02,360 --> 00:39:03,519
I'll pull you out beforehand.

603
00:39:03,800 --> 00:39:04,360
All right.

604
00:39:51,960 --> 00:39:53,119
Have your injuries healed?

605
00:39:53,119 --> 00:39:54,159
Coming in to work so early,

606
00:39:55,119 --> 00:39:55,920
can you handle it?

607
00:39:56,360 --> 00:39:58,199
Superficial wounds. Won't kill me yet.

608
00:39:58,599 --> 00:39:59,320
Don't worry.

609
00:40:01,840 --> 00:40:03,400
Luck was really on your side.

610
00:40:03,800 --> 00:40:04,960
Cao Liaoping is back.

611
00:40:05,119 --> 00:40:07,400
Got the last bag of Fujian pancakes.

612
00:40:09,719 --> 00:40:10,719
What's in here?

613
00:40:11,000 --> 00:40:12,559
Full account of Cao Liaoping's arrest.

614
00:40:12,719 --> 00:40:13,639
I drew up the plan,

615
00:40:13,760 --> 00:40:14,760
and I drove the car.

616
00:40:14,760 --> 00:40:16,360
See if anything else needs to be added.

617
00:40:17,679 --> 00:40:19,440
Drafting reviews, tossing around slogans—

618
00:40:19,440 --> 00:40:20,400
you have a way with fancy words.

619
00:40:20,760 --> 00:40:22,760
Spruce it up with some nice phrasing.

620
00:40:24,519 --> 00:40:25,360
Are you up for it?

621
00:40:25,519 --> 00:40:26,239
I'm fine.

622
00:40:26,480 --> 00:40:27,199
Where are you going?

623
00:40:27,840 --> 00:40:29,719
Isn't Cao Xiao'ou arriving soon?

624
00:40:30,000 --> 00:40:30,880
Got to get to work.

625
00:40:31,159 --> 00:40:32,119
Those two, uncle and nephew,

626
00:40:32,119 --> 00:40:33,719
fit together like a brass lock and key.

627
00:40:33,719 --> 00:40:34,360
I need to go question him.

628
00:40:34,480 --> 00:40:35,920
What's the reaction from Taiwan, China?

629
00:40:36,000 --> 00:40:37,400
Any word from Hong Kong, China?

630
00:40:40,400 --> 00:40:42,000
The word from Taipei is,

631
00:40:42,320 --> 00:40:43,639
as long as you're willing to consider it,

632
00:40:43,639 --> 00:40:45,760
you can name any terms you want.

633
00:40:46,480 --> 00:40:47,280
None on my end.

634
00:40:58,400 --> 00:40:59,159
Brother, brother.

635
00:41:01,000 --> 00:41:03,199
Your Price Bureau chief is a real pain.

636
00:41:03,519 --> 00:41:05,360
Didn't your brother-in-law put in a word?

637
00:41:05,440 --> 00:41:06,679
He's making trouble first thing today.

638
00:41:07,360 --> 00:41:08,239
You mean Qian Xinfu?

639
00:41:08,239 --> 00:41:09,159
Did he go to your factory again?

640
00:41:09,320 --> 00:41:10,599
The factory doesn't matter.

641
00:41:10,840 --> 00:41:11,760
At the city hospital,

642
00:41:11,760 --> 00:41:12,920
in the CT department we contracted,

643
00:41:12,920 --> 00:41:14,199
he demanded a fine first thing today.

644
00:41:14,320 --> 00:41:15,679
Claiming our fees exceed regulations.

645
00:41:15,800 --> 00:41:16,840
Demanding 10,000 yuan right off the bat.

646
00:41:17,039 --> 00:41:18,079
Didn't he call you?

647
00:41:18,599 --> 00:41:19,800
I'll talk to Brother Qi later.

648
00:41:19,800 --> 00:41:20,920
You guys better hurry.

649
00:41:20,920 --> 00:41:21,920
Get a dinner together.

650
00:41:22,079 --> 00:41:24,360
Time to butter up Qian Xinfu over drinks.

651
00:41:24,719 --> 00:41:25,840
They won't let us take scans,

652
00:41:25,840 --> 00:41:26,679
and patients are piling up.

653
00:41:26,760 --> 00:41:28,760
Some are from the Taiwan, China Chamber.

654
00:41:28,880 --> 00:41:29,559
I'll head over first.

655
00:41:33,280 --> 00:41:33,840
Let's go.

656
00:42:10,519 --> 00:42:11,400
What do you think?

657
00:42:12,199 --> 00:42:12,920
Very calm.

658
00:42:12,920 --> 00:42:13,639
Keeps his composure.

659
00:42:13,880 --> 00:42:15,360
Shows no emotional turbulence at all.

660
00:42:15,599 --> 00:42:16,800
If we hadn't checked his background,

661
00:42:17,199 --> 00:42:18,519
I'd doubt if the guy in Hong Kong, China

662
00:42:18,519 --> 00:42:19,440
was really him.

663
00:42:21,000 --> 00:42:21,880
You suspect me,

664
00:42:21,880 --> 00:42:23,000
and I suspect you.

665
00:42:23,199 --> 00:42:24,679
Clearly everyone has something to hide,

666
00:42:24,880 --> 00:42:27,159
yet when meeting, we talk so naturally.

667
00:42:27,320 --> 00:42:28,480
Separated by just a wall,

668
00:42:28,639 --> 00:42:29,880
bumping into each other all the time.

669
00:42:29,880 --> 00:42:32,119
First thing every morning is acting.

670
00:42:32,360 --> 00:42:33,719
Isn't that absurd?

671
00:42:34,519 --> 00:42:35,760
Life is just like that.

672
00:42:36,039 --> 00:42:37,400
Over time, you get used to it,

673
00:42:37,400 --> 00:42:38,320
forget that they're lies,

674
00:42:38,320 --> 00:42:39,519
and treat them as the truth.

675
00:42:41,280 --> 00:42:42,400
Isn't that right?

676
00:42:42,400 --> 00:42:43,559
Can anyone say that in their whole life

677
00:42:43,559 --> 00:42:44,639
they've never said something false,

678
00:42:44,639 --> 00:42:45,760
or never told a lie?

679
00:42:46,239 --> 00:42:47,440
That, I wouldn't know.

680
00:42:47,559 --> 00:42:49,639
I'll see if Cao Xiao'ou, helping us today,

681
00:42:49,760 --> 00:42:51,000
will tell any lies.

682
00:42:52,119 --> 00:42:53,119
It's getting late.

683
00:42:53,119 --> 00:42:53,880
For today's first session,

684
00:42:53,880 --> 00:42:54,880
Brother Qi told me to go first.

685
00:42:55,239 --> 00:42:55,960
You?

686
00:42:58,079 --> 00:42:58,960
What's wrong with me?

687
00:43:08,239 --> 00:43:09,079
I am Zu Feng.

688
00:43:09,079 --> 00:43:10,679
Inviting you to watch the drama series

689
00:43:10,679 --> 00:43:11,400
"Confrontation."

690
00:43:11,400 --> 00:43:13,599
Regarding Cao Liaoping in Hong Kong, China,

691
00:43:13,599 --> 00:43:16,000
our intel suffered a serious leak.

692
00:43:16,000 --> 00:43:18,360
There is a mole inside this building.

693
00:43:18,360 --> 00:43:19,760
Cao Xiao'ou! He's awake, he's awake!

694
00:43:19,760 --> 00:43:20,920
Which team is your favorite?

695
00:43:20,920 --> 00:43:22,679
What match did you watch? Who was playing?

696
00:43:22,679 --> 00:43:24,119
You must explain everything you know

697
00:43:24,119 --> 00:43:25,480
and all matters concerning your uncle,

698
00:43:25,480 --> 00:43:26,719
down to the last detail.

699
00:43:27,239 --> 00:43:29,960
Colluding with foreign entities or persons

700
00:43:29,960 --> 00:43:31,480
to endanger national sovereignty,

701
00:43:31,480 --> 00:43:32,760
under particularly heinous circumstances,

702
00:43:32,760 --> 00:43:33,880
can be sentenced to death.

703
00:43:33,880 --> 00:43:35,840
The evidence is already on the table.

704
00:43:35,840 --> 00:43:37,440
Our cards are on the table now.
